'''Jal-Xil''' are [[volcanic creatures]] fought in the [[Inferno]], and are apparently the ancestors of the present day [[Tok-Xil]].

They are exactly the same as the Tok-Xil, the only difference is that Jal-Xils boast higher combat stats.

